# Runtime config DBs — regenerated from seed, never tracked (contain DPAPI secrets + logs)
# ArtifactOSConfig.seed.db IS tracked (sanitized template: schema + static seed, Secrets empty).
# Recovery: cp ArtifactOSConfig.seed.db ArtifactOSConfig.db then --set-secret (see README §恢复).
ArtifactOSConfig.db
ArtifactOSTestsConfig.db
SmokeCandidatePackConfig.db

